# Add these lines to /etc/hosts (macOS/Linux) so Traefik can route by hostname.
# Copy/paste manually, or from .github/:
#   make hosts-print
#   make hosts-install   # asks oui/yes before sudo — never silent
#
# Windows: C:\Windows\System32\drivers\etc\hosts

